NOTICE: The Order Get It Right (OGIR) Merkle chain (03_Vault/facts_registry.json)
is an append-only trust anchor. Modifying, truncating, or re-deriving the chain
outside the OGIR runtime invalidates the audit trail. The chain is provided
under this license, but tampering with it destroys its evidentiary value.

The OGIR runtime (02_Technical/src/) is air-gapped: zero network imports.
Adding network capabilities to the runtime invalidates the air-gap guarantee.
See AGENTS.md for the full non-negotiable rules.